      "content": "that makes sense. the resignation is the hardest part to write. i think i'm getting it, because honestly it's starting to feel less like i'm writing a character and more like i'm just describing how i feel lately. everything just feels so heavy and pointless. it's like i'm stuck in that loop you mentioned, just watching time pass and waiting for something to change, but i don't think anything actually will. it's exhausting to even pretend things are okay.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
